message: "If you use TR-EIF in your work, please cite it using the metadata provided in this file."
title: "TR-EIF: Ternary Resonant Equivariant Interatomic Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Marnov"
    given-names: "Maksym"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  TR-EIF is a mathematical and computational framework integrating balanced
  ternary -1/0/1 dynamics, nonlinear resonance, equivariant mappings, and
  interatomic system modeling.
keywords:
  - balanced ternary
  - nonlinear resonance
  - equivariant modeling
  - interatomic systems
